 ## 1.6 Reflection

As the Agile Lead for BrightStart, my responsibility is to coordinate the team's workflow, encourage communication, and monitor progress. One challenge I could face is poor communication, which may cause misunderstandings and delays. I would encourage regular updates to ensure everyone understands their responsibilities.

Another challenge is balancing workloads and managing deadlines, especially when team members experience difficulties completing tasks. I would monitor task progress, help prioritise work, and encourage team members to raise problems early. I could also face disagreements between members, which would require me to listen to different opinions and encourage respectful discussions.

This role would help me develop my leadership, communication, and problem-solving skills. In future projects, I would focus on clear working agreements, regular progress tracking, and teamwork to ensure that the project stays on track and achieves its goals.
